	(text "Function (car controller)\nEncoder will be rotated and the value will be updated on the 7-seg display.\nThis will be the floor selector\n\nOnce you picked a floor (say 7), you can click the PB to either send the command directly\nOr this will function as a queue loader (multi-floor select like a real elevator) with the encoder switch being the send command\n\nThe LED flashes once when floor queued but glows when executing commands (like sending CAN out)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 42.164 112.522 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "47454eb1-2936-4157-b663-2344627cd3cf")
	)
